              <article class="news-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1532629345422-7515f3d16bb6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Emergency response team assisting families after hurricane landfall" loading="lazy">
                <div class="news-body"><span class="meta">Hurricane response update</span><h4>Field teams distribute shelter kits across coastal communities</h4><p>2,400 households received immediate support in the first week of operations.</p></div>
              </article>
              <article class="news-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1593113598332-cd59a93f7f70?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Volunteers packing food and emergency supplies in a warehouse" loading="lazy">
                <div class="news-body"><span class="meta">Wildfire relief efforts</span><h4>Mobile clinics expand services for displaced residents</h4><p>Health teams are now operating in four temporary shelter zones.</p></div>
              </article>
            </div>
            <div class="news-slide">
              <article class="news-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1615461066841-6116e61058f4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Community members participating in a local blood donation drive" loading="lazy">
                <div class="news-body"><span class="meta">Blood drive campaign</span><h4>National campaign reaches 75,000 units collected</h4><p>Partner hospitals report stabilized emergency blood reserves in key regions.</p></div>
              </article>
              <article class="news-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521737604893-d14cc237f11d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Volunteer team leaders meeting to coordinate relief activities" loading="lazy">
                <div class="news-body"><span class="meta">Volunteer spotlight</span><h4>Local responders recognized for rapid flood mobilization</h4><p>More than 600 trained volunteers deployed within 24 hours of impact.</p></div>
